    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n8:37 am from Louisiana & Pearl Station\r\n9:50 am from Southmoor Station\r\n10:50 am from Southmoor Station\r\n11:50 am from Southmoor Station\r\n12:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n1:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n2:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n3:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n4:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n5:50 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n9:28 am from Florida Station\r\n10:28 am from Florida Station\r\n11:28 am from Florida Station\r\n12:28 pm from Florida Station\r\n1:28 pm from Florida Station\r\n2:28 pm from Florida Station\r\n3:28 pm from Florida Station\r\n4:28 pm from Florida Station\r\n5:28 pm from Florida Station"
